---
/** @lang zh-CN 产品能力与演示入口，避免把示例或源码版本描述为正式系统发行。 @lang en Product capabilities and demonstrations without equating sample or source versions with a formal system release. */
import { href } from "../lib/routes.mjs";
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const en = locale === "en";
const text = (zh: string, english: string) => en ? english : zh;
const domains = [["JavaScript", "JSDoc / " + text("字段级双语", "field-level localization")], ["HTML", text("结构 / 模板", "structure / templates")], ["CSS", text("样式 / 标记", "styles / tokens")], [".NET", "C# / ASP.NET"]];
---
<main id="main" class="container"><div class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Features</p><h1>{text("把文档，放回工程本身。", "Bring documentation into engineering.")}</h1><p class="lede">{text("从输入、模型到阅读体验，让信息可说明、可关联、可检查。", "From inputs and models to reading: information that can be explained, linked, and checked.")}</p></div>
  <section class="feature-row" id="domains"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 · Domain aware</p><h2>{text("统一体系，尊重领域差异。", "One system. Domain-aware boundaries.")}</h2><p class="lede">{text("JavaScript、HTML、CSS和.NET各自保留领域模型。统一文档层连接输入、符号、双语内容和来源，具体能力以对应参考为准。", "JavaScript, HTML, CSS, and .NET retain their domain models. A shared document layer connects inputs, symbols, localization, and sources; each reference defines its exact capabilities.")}</p><a href={href("docs", locale, import.meta.env.BASE_URL)}>{text("查看参考与能力边界 →", "Explore references and capability boundaries →")}</a></div><div class="feature-visual">{domains.map(([name, caption]) => <div class="mini-row"><b>{name}</b><small>{caption}</small></div>)}</div></section>
  <section class="feature-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 · Meaning travels</p><h2>{text("双语内容与来源，一起保留。", "Keep meaning and source relations together.")}</h2><p class="lede">{text("字段的语义、使用说明与源码关联共同进入文档。精度、缺失和未核验状态明确呈现，阅读者不必猜测。实际保留内容取决于输入字段。", "Field semantics, usage notes, and source relations travel together. Precision, missing data, and unverified states remain explicit. Preserved content depends on the input fields.")}</p></div><div class="feature-visual"><h3>buildProfileSummary</h3><p>生成用户资料摘要。</p><p class="muted">Builds a user profile summary.</p><span class="pill blue">{text("参数与返回", "Parameters and returns")}</span> <span class="pill">{text("源码关联", "Source relations")}</span></div></section>
  <section class="section" id="examples"><h2>{text("在演示项目中，观察真实使用。", "See the system in use.")}</h2><p class="lede">{text("第一个JavaScript演示项目BP/bp-docs-js-cookie已有独立Portal与访客偏好指南。它们保留自己的已确认设计，是后续多个演示项目之一。", "The first JavaScript demonstration project, BP/bp-docs-js-cookie, has an independent API Portal and visitor preference guide. It retains its own confirmed designs and is one of multiple planned demonstration projects.")}</p><div class="grid three"><a class="card" href="https://mandolin.github.io/bp-docs-js-cookie/"><span class="card-number">01</span><h3>BP/bp-docs-js-cookie</h3><p>{text("访问演示项目的公开文档与指南入口。", "Visit the demonstration project's public documentation and guide.")}</p><span class="card-footer">{text("打开演示项目 →", "Open demonstration →")}</span></a><a class="card" href={"https://mandolin.github.io/HIA-Documentation/" + locale + "/"}><span class="card-number">02</span><h3>{text("HIA生成的代码文档", "HIA-generated code documentation")}</h3><p>{text("阅读当前公开工具参考，不将设计样本当作生成结果。", "Read the existing generated tool reference.")}</p><span class="card-footer">{text("浏览代码文档 →", "Browse code documentation →")}</span></a><a class="card" href="https://github.com/mandolin/HIA-Documentation/tree/main/examples"><span class="card-number">03</span><h3>{text("公开示例", "Public examples")}</h3><p>{text("从仓库样本了解工件、生产器与文档构建。", "Explore artifacts, producers, and documentation builds through repository samples.")}</p><span class="card-footer">{text("查看示例 →", "Explore examples →")}</span></a></div></section>
</main>
